      "content": "i rly dont think a phone call is gonna change the fact that i've nothing left. i feel like i've already checked out. people say things get better but i dont see it happening. it just feels like a long, exhausting cycle that needs to end. wouldnt it just be more peaceful if it just... ended?\n Balance the emotions and of being exhausted",
